    postImage: '432bf-bone and health.jpg',
    postDesc:
      '<h2>Bone &amp; Health &ndash; Spaks Homeopathy</h2>\r\n\r\n<p>Bones are the <strong>foundation of our body</strong>. They provide structure, protect vital organs, anchor muscles, and store essential minerals like <strong>calcium</strong>. Building strong bones during <strong>childhood and adolescence</strong> is crucial, but taking care of bone health in adulthood is equally important.</p>\r\n\r\n<hr />\r\n<h3>Why Bone Health Matters</h3>\r\n\r\n<p>Bones are <strong>constantly renewing</strong> &mdash; new bone is created, while old bone is broken down.</p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n\t<li>\r\n\t<p>In youth, bone formation is faster, leading to increased bone mass.</p>\r\n\t</li>\r\n\t<li>\r\n\t<p>Most people achieve <strong>peak bone mass by age 30</strong>.</p>\r\n\t</li>\r\n\t<li>\r\n\t<p>After this, bone renewal slows, and gradual loss begins, which may lead to weak bones and fractures if not managed properly.</p>\r\n\t</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<hr />\r\n<h3>Risk Factors &amp; Symptoms of Poor Bone Health</h3>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n\t<li>\r\n\t<p><strong>Calcium deficiency</strong> &ndash; Leads to low bone density, early bone loss, and higher fracture risk.</p>\r\n\t</li>\r\n\t<li>\r\n\t<p><strong>Lack of physical activity</strong> &ndash; Inactive individuals face a higher risk of osteoporosis.</p>\r\n\t</li>\r\n\t<li>\r\n\t<p><strong>Tobacco use</strong> &ndash; Weakens bones over time.</p>\r\n\t</li>\r\n\t<li>\r\n\t<p><strong>Excess alcohol consumption</strong> &ndash; More than 1 drink daily for women or 2 for men can raise bone disease risk.</p>\r\n\t</li>\r\n\t<li>\r\n\t<p><strong>Gender</strong> &ndash; Women are more prone due to lower bone tissue compared to men.</p>\r\n\t</li>\r\n\t<li>\r\n\t<p><strong>Body size</strong> &ndash; Very thin individuals (BMI &le; 19) or those with small frames may have lower bone reserves.</p>\r\n\t</li>\r\n\t<li>\r\n\t<p><strong>Age factor</strong> &ndash; Bones naturally become weaker with increasing age.</p>\r\n\t</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<hr />\r\n<p><strong>Spaks Homeopathy Care:</strong><br />\r\nAt Spaks, we focus on strengthening bones naturally by improving calcium absorption, boosting vitality, and preventing complications like osteoporosis &mdash; <strong>without side effects</strong>.</p>',
